(20) citizen member of the Legislative-Citizen Commission on Minnesota Resources;
(21) manager of a watershed district, or member of a watershed management organization as defined under section 103B.205, subdivision 13;
(22) supervisor of a soil and water conservation district;
(23) director of Explore Minnesota Tourism;
(24) citizen member of the Lessard-Sams Outdoor Heritage Council established in section 97A.056;
(25) citizen member of the Clean Water Council established in section 114D.30;
(26) member or chief executive of the Minnesota Sports Facilities Authority established in section 473J.07;
(27) district court judge, appeals court judge, or supreme court justice;
(28) county commissioner;
(29) member of the Greater Minnesota Regional Parks and Trails Commission;
(30) member of the Destination Medical Center Corporation established in section 469.41; or
(31) chancellor or member of the Board of Trustees of the Minnesota State Colleges and Universities.

